        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "###### Local Indicator of Spatial Association (LISA)",
          "",
          "The global Moran's I test shows whether similar values sit next to each other, but not where. LISA answers the where: a local Moran's I for each H3 cell compares the cell with its neighbours, and a permutation test tells whether the pattern is significant. Each significant cell gets one of four quadrants:",
          "",
          "1. **HH (High-High): heat island.** A hot cell among hot cells, for example the dense centre, industrial areas or large car parks.",
          "1. **LH (Low-High): cool outlier.** A cool cell in a hot neighbourhood, for example a park in the hot core.",
          "1. **LL (Low-Low): cool island.** A cool cell among cool cells, for example Maksimir, Jarun or the Sava banks.",
          "1. **HL (High-Low): hot outlier.** A hot cell in a cool neighbourhood, for example an asphalt plaza or a large roof between green areas.",
          "",
          "Cells that are not significant get the label -1."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : false,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : {
          "interpreter" : "md.low",
          "taskStatus" : "SUCCESS",
          "status" : "SUCCESS",
          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "<h6 id=\"local-indicator-of-spatial-association-lisa\">Local Indicator of Spatial Association (LISA)</h6>\n<p>The global Moran's I test shows whether similar values sit next to each other, but not where. LISA answers the where: a local Moran's I for each H3 cell compares the cell with its neighbours, and a permutation test tells whether the pattern is significant. Each significant cell gets one of four quadrants:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>HH (High-High): heat island.</strong> A hot cell among hot cells, for example the dense centre, industrial areas or large car parks.</li>\n<li><strong>LH (Low-High): cool outlier.</strong> A cool cell in a hot neighbourhood, for example a park in the hot core.</li>\n<li><strong>LL (Low-Low): cool island.</strong> A cool cell among cool cells, for example Maksimir, Jarun or the Sava banks.</li>\n<li><strong>HL (High-Low): hot outlier.</strong> A hot cell in a cool neighbourhood, for example an asphalt plaza or a large roof between green areas.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Cells that are not significant get the label -1.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
        },
        "relations" : [ ],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
