          "taskStatus" : "SUCCESS",
          "status" : "SUCCESS",
          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "<h6 id=\"1-is-surface-heat-clustered-or-randomly-spread\">1. Is surface heat clustered, or randomly spread?</h6>\n<p>The spatial weights define who is a neighbour: every H3 cell and its 6 nearest cells, the ring of hexagons around it. For the stops, the 6 nearest stops.</p>\n<p>Global Moran's I is close to 0 (more precisely, its expected value) when values are spread at random, and positive when similar values sit next to each other. A p-value below 0.05 means the pattern is very unlikely to be random.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
        },
        "relations" : [ ],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : "Global Moran's I for the H3 cells and for the stops",
        "hasTitle" : true,
        "message" : [
          "%python",
          "",
          "weights_def = KNNWeightsDefinition(k=6)",
          "",
          "moran_cells = MoranITest.create(X, weights_def, column_name='LST_C')",
          "moran_stops = MoranITest.create(stops_gdf[['LST_C', 'geometry']].to_crs(ANALYSIS_CRS), weights_def, column_name='LST_C')",
          "",
          "def verdict(t):",
          "    if t.p_value >= 0.05:",
          "        return 'randomly spread'",
          "    return 'clustered' if t.i > t.expected_i else 'dispersed'",
          "",
          "for name, t in [('H3 cells (city surface)', moran_cells), ('ZET stops', moran_stops)]:",
          "    print(f\"{name:24}  Moran's I = {t.i:.3f} (random: {t.expected_i:.4f})  z = {t.z_value:6.1f}  p = {t.p_value:.4f}  ->  {verdict(t)}\")"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "raw",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
