            {
              "message" : "<p>The <code>regions_</code> property of <code>LISAHotspotClustering</code> groups adjacent cells with the same quadrant into contiguous regions. It is a dictionary with the quadrants as keys; each value is a list of regions, and each region is a list of cell indexes.</p>\n",
